Attribution and Joobox link
---------------------------
The module installs with a small, non-intrusive Joobox footer attribution text in displayFooterAfter when available enabled by default in the shop footer. The footer text is: "We use prestashop modules joobox.eu". The word "prestashop" links to https://joobox.eu and identifies the module ecosystem used by the shop.

By installing the module, the user acknowledges that this footer text and link are created automatically. The module does not provide a Back Office switch to disable this attribution.

Warranty disclaimer
