The module is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. JOO INTERNET MEDIA LTD is not responsible for lost orders, failed payments, incorrect configuration, incompatibility with third-party modules, hosting limitations, bank/acquirer configuration, or any direct or indirect damage caused by installation or use of the module.

Production use
--------------
Before using the module in production, the merchant must test the complete payment flow with GP webpay / ČSOB, including successful payment, failed payment, return signature verification, order-state mapping, refunds and cron reconciliation.
